.SS Retrieving Files Using Regular Expressions
To collect files starting with \fC.zsh\fP under the remote host's home directory and store them in the \fCdest\fP directory, use \fCgm-gather\fP as follows:
.PP
.EX
gm-gather '~/\.zsh.*' dest
.EE
.PP
